00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:16,237
If we tried going back the way
we came, we'd get blown to bits.

255
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,150
So?

256
00:15:17,233 --> 00:15:18,097
What do you think?

257
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,592
The choice is pretty clear now, isn't it?

258
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:24,237
A waterfall of death behind us?

259
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,497
A mysterious path ahead?

260
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:26,657
Which way would you go?

261
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:28,617
The mysterious path ahead, of course.

262
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:29,530
Exactly.

263
00:15:29,613 --> 00:15:31,757
So once we've freed everyone
and we're done in this tower,

264
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,899
we'll meet at the Gates of Justice.

265
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,177
After that, just leave everything...

266
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:37,740
To you? To luck.

267
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,214
Oh, that's just great.

268
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:47,700
Come on.

269
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:50,155
We've wasted quite a bit of time here.

270
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:52,680
Damn right you have.

271
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:53,897
I can't believe you two.

272
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:56,077
