around at a time like this?

273
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:56,990
Because!

274
00:15:57,073 --> 00:15:58,915
He wouldn't stop acting like an idiot!

275
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,477
You're both acting like idiots!

276
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,207
Hurry up and get those keys!

277
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:03,300
Tempest kick?

278
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:06,680
