311
00:17:52,980 --> 00:17:59,337
Oh, uh, okay then, I'll just,
uh, take this key and, uh...

312
00:17:59,420 --> 00:18:00,500
No, look out!

313
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,540
Ten-figure pistol!

314
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:09,760
