329
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,240
Special attack, Sunflower Star!

330
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:13,040
Wow, a fireworks show.

331
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:15,397
No, Usopp!

332
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,500
Moonwalk!

333
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,300
Leave him alone!

334
00:19:44,340 --> 00:19:47,777
just like i promised i'll
kill you quickly there won't

335
00:19:47,860 --> 00:19:51,397
be any pain it's too bad
really you were so much better

336
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:53,757
off when you were connected
to that green-haired shepherd

337
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:56,957
over there but since this
little lamb has wandered off on

338
00:19:57,040 --> 00:20:00,357
his own things are a bit
different now you're nothing

339
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:07,037
but a tasty morsel for the
big scary wolf this is the end

